{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Ben James (Cardboard Computer), with support from Jake Elliott, writer and creator of <i>Kentucky Route Zero</i>, it offers a first taste of the game. In this demo you can traverse <strong>3 of the 30+ surreal locations</strong> planned for the full version, solve intriguing puzzles, and immerse yourself in a meditative journey between light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And here\u2019s what you\u2019ll find in the full game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/d68fff8ccd5a0bd21161cca89733fd02.avif?t=1758633325\" data-has-big width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a world you once knew, now shrouded in darkness. Splash it with color to reveal your path forward through the invisible levels, and turn it into beautiful artwork as you play. Restore this dreamy realm's forgotten beauty and light as you uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.poster.avif?t=1758633325\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.webm?t=1758633325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.mp4?t=1758633325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/4a61819a2fccfa242c0ac0fa46935aca.avif?t=1758633325\" data-has-big width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse over 30 mind-bending locations, solve intriguing puzzles, and face powerful bosses. Every step brings you closer to the source of the mysterious darkness. As you progress, you will gain new abilities that allow you to paint in new fun ways and discover a kaleidoscope of powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.poster.avif?t=1758633325\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.webm?t=1758633325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.mp4?t=1758633325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/dfdc6f06cdafacb6d2d8fc34cb801d09.avif?t=1758633325\" data-has-big width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel alongside your spirit guide, Phoebe, who knew you in your past. Bring back balance, color, and life to this enchanting dreamscape by <i>Finding Your Way</i> forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.poster.avif?t=1758633325\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.webm?t=1758633325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853810?t=1758633325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/2c73b0f0947dde9c12b665929e4155bf5937db8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758633325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/17cf622d8fb33a2145d83d2b3dccb94806c4edaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758633325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/17cf622d8fb33a2145d83d2b3dccb94806c4edaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758633325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Ben James (Cardboard Computer), with support from Jake Elliott, writer and creator of <i>Kentucky Route Zero</i>, it offers a first taste of the game. In this demo you can traverse <strong>3 of the 30+ surreal locations</strong> planned for the full version, solve intriguing puzzles, and immerse yourself in a meditative journey between light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And here\u2019s what you\u2019ll find in the full game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853810/extras/d68fff8ccd5a0bd21161cca89733fd02.avif?t=1758633325\" data-has-big width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a world you once knew, now shrouded in darkness. Splash it with color to reveal your path forw